Z||000003||PBJ||12-19-2001||09:18 PM||||starter solenoid is mounted directly to the starter. You will want to remove the starter to gain access to it.  Be sure to put penetrating fluid on the bolts that hold the solenoid to starter, are little and like to snap.  As for why 5 diff?  I would try another parts source to confirm.||||reg||1
